{"about_the_game":"<i>Welcome to the world of cozy correspondence, where you are a postcard designer!</i><br><br><strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> is a wholesome postcard-making sandbox game where you take on the charming job of a postcard designer. Craft delightful cards, decorate with adorable stickers, write sweet notes, and match the perfect stamp\u2014all while enjoying relaxing tunes and satisfying vibes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.poster.avif?t=1761882203\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.webm?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.mp4?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you\u2019re creating personalized mail for quirky customers or building your own dreamy stamp collection, there\u2019s always a reason to send a little joy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.poster.avif?t=1761882203\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.webm?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.mp4?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcee Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft &amp; Sell:</strong> Take on customer orders and craft postcards that match their unique requests and personalities.<br></li><li><strong>Design Freely:</strong> Decorate with a wide variety of cute stickers, washi tapes, doodles, and more!<br></li><li><strong>Write Notes:</strong> Pen short, wholesome messages to make every postcard feel personal and heartfelt.<br></li><li><strong>Collect Stamps:</strong> Unlock and collect a colorful assortment of stamps\u2014from vintage vibes to quirky icons.<br></li><li><strong>Wholesome Sandbox Mode:</strong> No timers. No pressure. Just cozy creativity and peaceful play.<br></li><li><strong>Relaxing Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy calming background tunes while you let your creativity flow.<br></li><li><strong>Mailing Magic:</strong> Drop your finished postcards into the mailbox and watch them go on their way!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5b21695d8facab1537e91442697cbe8d.poster.avif?t=1761882203\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5b21695d8facab1537e91442697cbe8d.webm?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5b21695d8facab1537e91442697cbe8d.mp4?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c A Game for Stationery Lovers</strong></h2>If you\u2019ve ever fallen down a sticker organization rabbit hole or lost time browsing through cute stationery, this is the game for you. <strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> turns the art of mailing into a joyful experience.<br><br><i>So grab your favorite pen, pick out a stamp, and let the postcard magic begin!</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771390?t=1761882203","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771390?t=1761882203","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/fb09952373e292c37dedde6a6994e18c74a651dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761882203","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/fb09952373e292c37dedde6a6994e18c74a651dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761882203","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Play the Demo First</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/c1d1eac0776218612093cb99e80dff89.avif?t=1761882203\" width=1560 height=460 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>Welcome to the world of cozy correspondence, where you are a postcard designer!</i><br><br><strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> is a wholesome postcard-making sandbox game where you take on the charming job of a postcard designer. Craft delightful cards, decorate with adorable stickers, write sweet notes, and match the perfect stamp\u2014all while enjoying relaxing tunes and satisfying vibes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.poster.avif?t=1761882203\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.webm?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5d1e7c4d0bb08871814478f3e70b3844.mp4?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Whether you\u2019re creating personalized mail for quirky customers or building your own dreamy stamp collection, there\u2019s always a reason to send a little joy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.poster.avif?t=1761882203\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.webm?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/44afa52852f3d14b1c82fdae4f846d82.mp4?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcee Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Craft &amp; Sell:</strong> Take on customer orders and craft postcards that match their unique requests and personalities.<br></li><li><strong>Design Freely:</strong> Decorate with a wide variety of cute stickers, washi tapes, doodles, and more!<br></li><li><strong>Write Notes:</strong> Pen short, wholesome messages to make every postcard feel personal and heartfelt.<br></li><li><strong>Collect Stamps:</strong> Unlock and collect a colorful assortment of stamps\u2014from vintage vibes to quirky icons.<br></li><li><strong>Wholesome Sandbox Mode:</strong> No timers. No pressure. Just cozy creativity and peaceful play.<br></li><li><strong>Relaxing Soundtrack:</strong> Enjoy calming background tunes while you let your creativity flow.<br></li><li><strong>Mailing Magic:</strong> Drop your finished postcards into the mailbox and watch them go on their way!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5b21695d8facab1537e91442697cbe8d.poster.avif?t=1761882203\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5b21695d8facab1537e91442697cbe8d.webm?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/extras/5b21695d8facab1537e91442697cbe8d.mp4?t=1761882203\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c A Game for Stationery Lovers</strong></h2>If you\u2019ve ever fallen down a sticker organization rabbit hole or lost time browsing through cute stationery, this is the game for you. <strong>Carefully Stamped</strong> turns the art of mailing into a joyful experience.<br><br><i>So grab your favorite pen, pick out a stamp, and let the postcard magic begin!</i>","developers":["Rogue Duck Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771390/79b57bb78e9df68e6b08afffdb8ff75a579a04da/header.jpg?t=1761882203","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 - Rogue Duck Interactive, Published by Rogue Duck Interactive LLC and Co-published in Asia Regions (China, Korea, Japan) by Gamersky Games","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04, SteamOS (Proton-8 Recommended)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.7 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8 or higher, ATI X1600 or higher, or Intel HD 3000 or hig